    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42023" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">runcīno</span></b> , āre,
			v. a.
		1. runcina, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to plane off</i>, <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 6, § 96</span></i>
			Müll.; <i><span class="en">Arn. 5,
			177</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, com.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ego illum probe jam oneratum runcinabo,</span>”
				i. e. <i>will take in</i>, <i>cheat</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Mil. 3, 3, 61</span></i>
			.</div>
